[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Windows Apps (Lindos)
GenericName=Seamless Windows apps over RDP
Comment=Run Windows programs (Adobe, Office) from your own licensed Windows over RDP
Exec=lindos-winapps list
